  "bodyHash": "1a74aaf2ae613533",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TpgjtVL.png\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"1052\" height=\"592\"></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><strong>警告！<span style=\"color:#f00\">你必須使用 Optifine 才能運作！<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">如果你使用的是 Fabric，<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> 與 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a> 同樣有效</span></span></strong></span><br><br></span>此資源包新增了更多美麗的可馴服狗狗種類！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如果你打算升級世界，狗狗的紋理在版本更新後通常會保持一致，<strong>然而，資源包的每次新更新通常都會加入新的狗狗種類，這意味著你很可能無法再遇到之前那種狗狗了！</strong>你可以透過兩種方式解決這個問題：不更新資源包，或者更新後在世界中尋找相同種類的狗狗！</span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>使用方法</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">下載資源包。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">將其放入你的 resourcepacks 資料夾中。（可選擇不解壓縮。）</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">開啟 Minecraft 啟動器並啟動你的 Optifine 版本。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">現在即可使用了！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:10px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">此資源包最初發佈於我的 <a style=\"color:#999\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252frealaj_%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">PMC</a>，歡迎前往查看！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
